{
  "format": "srwb",
  "format_version": "1.0",
  "exported_at": "2026-08-15T17:23:57.843Z",
  "notebook": {
    "id": "default",
    "name": "コールグラフ解析と強連結成分（SCC）検出",
    "autoNameNumber": null,
    "description": "",
    "kernelLanguage": "prolog",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 38,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# コールグラフ解析と強連結成分（SCC）検出\n\nこのノートブックでは、UnifyWeaver の高度なコード解析機能を探求します:\n\n- **コールグラフの構築** - Prolog コードからの依存関係グラフの構築\n- **強連結成分（SCC）の検出** - 強連結成分（相互再帰）の検出\n- **パターン解析** - 再帰パターンの理解\n- **依存関係の視覚化** - 述語間の関係の視覚化\n\n## 学習目標\n\n- UnifyWeaver がコード構造をどのように解析するかを理解する\n- コールグラフを構築して検査する\n- Tarjan のアルゴリズムを使用して相互再帰を検出する\n- コードの依存関係を視覚化する",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "## セットアップ\n\nUnifyWeaver と解析モジュールをロードします。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "% 初期化をロード\n['../init'].\n\n% 解析モジュールをロード\nuse_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/call_graph)).\nuse_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/scc_detection)).\nuse_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/pattern_matchers)).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Cannot find file: ../init",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Cannot find file: ../init</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "## 例 1: シンプルなコールグラフ\n\nシンプルな述語から始めて、そのコールグラフを構築してみましょう。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "% ancestor 述語を定義\n:- dynamic ancestor/2.\n:- dynamic parent/2.\n\n% parent の事実\nparent(abraham, isaac).\nparent(isaac, jacob).\n\n% ancestor の規則\nancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Y).\nancestor(X, Z) :- parent(X, Y), ancestor(Y, Z).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "### コールグラフの構築",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "% ancestor のコールグラフを構築\nbuild_call_graph([ancestor/2], _Graph),\nformat('Call Graph for ancestor/2:~n'),\nforall(member(_Edge, _Graph),\n    format('  ~w~n', [_Edge])).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "### 依存関係の解析",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "% ancestor/2 のすべての依存関係を取得\nget_dependencies(ancestor/2, _Deps),\nformat('Dependencies of ancestor/2: ~w~n', [_Deps]).\n\n% 自己再帰的であるか確認\n(is_self_recursive(ancestor/2) ->\n    writeln('✓ ancestor/2 is self-recursive')\n;\n    writeln('✗ ancestor/2 is not self-recursive')\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: get_dependencies/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: get_dependencies/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "code": "## 例 2: 相互再帰の検出\n\n偶数・奇数の例を用いて、相互再帰を検出してみましょう。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "code": "% 相互再帰述語を定義\n:- dynamic is_even/1.\n:- dynamic is_odd/1.\n\nis_even(0).\nis_even(N) :- N > 0, N1 is N - 1, is_odd(N1).\n\nis_odd(1).\nis_odd(N) :- N > 1, N1 is N - 1, is_even(N1).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "code": "### 両方の述語に対するコールグラフの構築",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "code": "% 両方の述語に対するコールグラフを構築\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\nformat('Call Graph for is_even/1 and is_odd/1:~n'),\nforall(member(_Edge, _Graph),\n    format('  ~w~n', [_Edge])).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "code": "### 強連結成分（SCC）の探索",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "code": "% ノートブックのセル間で変数が保持されないためグラフを再構築\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\n% Tarjan のアルゴリズムを使用して SCC を検出\nfind_sccs(_Graph, _SCCs),\nformat('Strongly Connected Components:~n'),\nforall(member(_SCC, _SCCs),\n    format('  ~w~n', [_SCC])).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "code": "### SCC が自明（Trivial）かどうかの確認",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "code": "% このセルも独立して実行できるように導出値を再構築\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\nfind_sccs(_Graph, _SCCs),\n% 各 SCC を確認\nforall(member(_SCC, _SCCs),\n    (   is_trivial_scc(_SCC) ->\n        format('  ~w is trivial (single predicate)~n', [_SCC])\n    ;\n        format('  ~w is NON-TRIVIAL (mutual recursion!)~n', [_SCC])\n    )\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "code": "## 例 3: 複雑なコールグラフ\n\n複数の述語を持つより複雑なシステムを解析してみましょう。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "code": "% 複数の述語を持つ小さなプログラムを定義\n:- dynamic grandparent/2.\n:- dynamic sibling/2.\n:- dynamic cousin/2.\n\n% grandparent は parent を使用\ngrandparent(X, Z) :- parent(X, Y), parent(Y, Z).\n\n% sibling: 同じ親、異なる子供\nsibling(X, Y) :- parent(P, X), parent(P, Y), X \\= Y.\n\n% cousin: 親同士が兄弟姉妹\ncousin(X, Y) :- parent(P1, X), parent(P2, Y), sibling(P1, P2).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "code": "### 完全なコールグラフの構築",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 21,
        "code": "% すべての述語に対するコールグラフを構築\nbuild_call_graph([grandparent/2, sibling/2, cousin/2], _Graph),\nformat('Complete Call Graph:~n'),\nforall(member(_Edge, _Graph),\n    format('  ~w~n', [_Edge])).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 22,
        "code": "### 述語グループの検索\n\n開始述語を含む相互再帰述語グループを検索します。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 23,
        "code": "% cousin/2 を含む相互再帰グループを検索\npredicates_in_group(cousin/2, _Group),\nformat('Mutually recursive group containing cousin/2: ~w~n', [_Group]).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: predicates_in_group/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: predicates_in_group/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 24,
        "code": "## 例 4: パターン検出\n\nパターンマッチャーを使用して再帰のタイプを解析します。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "code": "% さまざまな再帰パターンを定義\n:- dynamic count/3.     % 末尾再帰\n:- dynamic factorial/2. % 線形再帰\n:- dynamic fib/2.       % 木再帰（または検出された場合は線形再帰）\n\n% 末尾再帰によるカウント\ncount([], Acc, Acc).\ncount([_|T], Acc, N) :-\n    Acc1 is Acc + 1,\n    count(T, Acc1, N).\n\n% 線形再帰による階乗\nfactorial(0, 1).\nfactorial(N, F) :-\n    N > 0,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    factorial(N1, F1),\n    F is N * F1.\n\n% フィボナッチ（線形または木再帰として検出可能）\nfib(0, 0).\nfib(1, 1).\nfib(N, F) :-\n    N > 1,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    N2 is N - 2,\n    fib(N1, F1),\n    fib(N2, F2),\n    F is F1 + F2.",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "code": "### 末尾再帰の検出",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 27,
        "code": "% count/3 が末尾再帰か確認\n(is_tail_recursive_accumulator(count/3, _AccInfo) ->\n    format('✓ count/3 is tail recursive: ~w~n', [_AccInfo])\n;\n    writeln('✗ count/3 is not tail recursive')\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: is_tail_recursive_accumulator/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: is_tail_recursive_accumulator/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 28,
        "code": "### 線形再帰の検出",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 29,
        "code": "% factorial/2 が線形再帰か確認\n(is_linear_recursive_streamable(factorial/2) ->\n    writeln('✓ factorial/2 is linear recursive')\n;\n    writeln('✗ factorial/2 is not linear recursive')\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: is_linear_recursive_streamable/1",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: is_linear_recursive_streamable/1</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 30,
        "code": "### 再帰呼び出しのカウント",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 31,
        "code": "% fibonacci の再帰呼び出しをカウント\nfunctor(_FibHead, fib, 2),\nuser:clause(_FibHead, _FibBody),\nonce(contains_call_to(_FibBody, fib)),\ncount_recursive_calls(_FibBody, fib, _Count),\nformat('Fibonacci body has ~w recursive calls~n', [_Count]).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "once/1: Unknown procedure: contains_call_to/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">once/1: Unknown procedure: contains_call_to/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 32,
        "code": "## DOT 形式による視覚化\n\nコールグラフの Graphviz DOT 表現を生成してみましょう。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 33,
        "code": "% DOT 形式を生成するヘルパー\ngenerate_dot(Graph, DotCode) :-\n    findall(Line,\n        (   member(From -> To, Graph),\n            format(atom(Line), '  \"~w\" -> \"~w\";', [From, To])\n        ),\n        Lines),\n    atomic_list_concat(['digraph CallGraph {', '  rankdir=LR;' | Lines], '\\n', Body),\n    format(atom(DotCode), '~w~n}~n', [Body]).\n\n% 偶数/奇数グラフの DOT を生成\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\ngenerate_dot(_Graph, _DotCode),\nwriteln('DOT Code for even/odd call graph:'),\nwriteln(_DotCode).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 34,
        "code": "### DOT ファイルの保存",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 35,
        "code": "% セル間で変数が保持されないため DOT ソースを再構築\nbuild_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\ngenerate_dot(_Graph, _DotCode),\nsetup_call_cleanup(\n    open('/shared/data/even_odd_graph.dot', write, _Stream),\n    write(_Stream, _DotCode),\n    close(_Stream)),\nwriteln('✓ Saved to /shared/data/even_odd_graph.dot').\n\nwriteln('To visualize, run:'),\nwriteln('  dot -Tpng /shared/data/even_odd_graph.dot -o even_odd_graph.png').",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: build_call_graph/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 36,
        "code": "## 演習問題: あなた自身のコードを解析してみよう\n\n独自の述語を定義して解析してみましょう！",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 37,
        "code": "% ここに述語を定義\n% その後、コールグラフを構築し、SCC を検出し、パターンを判別\n\n% 例:\n% :- dynamic my_predicate/2.\n% my_predicate(...) :- ...\n\n% build_call_graph([my_predicate/2], Graph).\n",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 38,
        "code": "## まとめ\n\nこのノートブックで学んだこと:\n\n✅ Prolog コードからコールグラフを構築する方法\n\n✅ 相互再帰のための強連結成分（SCC）を検出する方法\n\n✅ パターンマッチャーを使用して再帰タイプを分類する方法\n\n✅ 述語の依存関係を解析する方法\n\n✅ DOT 形式でコールグラフを視覚化する方法\n\n## 発展トピック\n\nより高度な解析のためのトピック:\n\n- **トポロジカルソート**: `topological_order/2` を使用して、依存関係に従って SCC を順序付けする\n- **カスタムパターンマッチャー**: 独自のパターン検出述語を作成する\n- **アキュムレータパターンの抽出**: 詳細な解析のために `extract_accumulator_pattern/2` を使用する\n- **線形再帰の禁止**: `forbid_linear_recursion/1` を使用して異なるコンパイル戦略を強制する\n\n## 参考文献・関連ファイル\n\n- 第10章: Prolog のイントロスペクションと理論\n- `src/unifyweaver/core/advanced/call_graph.pl`\n- `src/unifyweaver/core/advanced/scc_detection.pl`\n- `src/unifyweaver/core/advanced/pattern_matchers.pl`",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      }
    ]
  }
}